---
import Icon from '../icons/Icon.astro';
---

<section id="faq" class="py-24 border-t border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] bg-white dark:bg-[#0A0E17] transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Section Header in Lamossa Style -->
    <div class="text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FF4D36]/10 text-[#FF4D36] text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-sm bg-[#FF4D36]"></span>
        <span>Common Questions</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">
        Frequently asked questions
      </h2>

      <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Everything you need to know about our enterprise platform, compliance, and onboarding.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Accordions -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="faq-item p-6 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] space-y-2 cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-[#FF4D36]/30">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white text-base">
          <span>How fast can we migrate from Intercom, HubSpot, or Zendesk?</span>
          <span class="text-[#FF4D36] text-lg font-mono font-bold">+</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed pt-1">
          Most revenue teams complete their full migration in under 2 hours. We provide 1-click import scripts for contact histories, conversation transcripts, deal pipeline stages, and active WhatsApp Business numbers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="faq-item p-6 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] space-y-2 cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-[#FF4D36]/30">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white text-base">
          <span>Can we bring our existing official WhatsApp Business API numbers?</span>
          <span class="text-[#FF4D36] text-lg font-mono font-bold">+</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed pt-1">
          Yes! You can port existing Meta WhatsApp Business API accounts or provision new dedicated regional phone numbers directly from your New-Relay console in 60 seconds with green checkmark verification support.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="faq-item p-6 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] space-y-2 cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-[#FF4D36]/30">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white text-base">
          <span>How does Captain AI prevent hallucinations on pricing and contract terms?</span>
          <span class="text-[#FF4D36] text-lg font-mono font-bold">+</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed pt-1">
          Captain AI operates on deterministic Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) coupled with rigid Scenario Decision Trees. If confidence falls below 90%, it triggers AI Copilot to draft a proposed response for human rep approval instead of sending autonomously.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="faq-item p-6 rounded-3xl bg-[#F6F7F8] dark:bg-[#0E131C] border border-[#E5E7EB] dark:border-[#1E2636] space-y-2 cursor-pointer transition-all hover:border-[#FF4D36]/30">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white text-base">
          <span>Is customer data ever retained or used to train external AI models?</span>
          <span class="text-[#FF4D36] text-lg font-mono font-bold">+</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed pt-1">
          Never. New-Relay strictly enforces Zero Data Retention policies. All messages and internal documents are isolated in single-tenant memory enclaves with AES-256 encryption. We sign formal enterprise Business Associate Agreements (BAA).
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
